<main>
<header>
<div class="eyebrow">小小浮力实验室</div>
<h1>货物有多重，船就沉多深？</h1>
<p>拖动货物滑块，看看船身怎样下沉。船越重，需要排开越多水，浮力才能托住它；但船口有一道不能越过的边界。</p>
</header>
<section class="layout" aria-label="载货与吃水互动模型">
<article class="card visual-card">
<div class="visual-top"><div><h2>船在水里的样子</h2><p class="micro">示意图：水线会随当前吃水移动</p></div><span class="badge" id="sceneBadge">漂浮平衡</span></div>
<svg class="scene" viewBox="0 0 600 330" role="img" aria-labelledby="svgTitle svgDesc">
<title id="svgTitle">长方形船体吃水示意图</title><desc id="svgDesc">船体高零点五米，水线表示当前吃水，标尺表示水面到船底的距离。</desc>
<defs><pattern id="waves" width="48" height="18" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M0 9 Q12 2 24 9 T48 9" fill="none" stroke="#a6e0e8" stroke-width="2" opacity=".75"/></pattern><linearGradient id="sea" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#b9eaf0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#70c9d8"/></linearGradient></defs>
<rect x="40" y="62" width="520" height="220" rx="18" fill="#f3faf9"/>
<rect id="water" x="40" y="192" width="520" height="90" fill="url(#sea)"/><rect id="wavePattern" x="40" y="192" width="520" height="24" fill="url(#waves)"/>
<line x1="55" y1="192" x2="545" y2="192" stroke="#167f90" stroke-width="3"/>
<g id="boat" class="boat"><path d="M170 122 H430 V242 Q430 251 420 251 H180 Q170 251 170 242 Z" fill="#f8fbf5" stroke="#315760" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M170 232 H430 V242 Q430 251 420 251 H180 Q170 251 170 242 Z" fill="#d7a65a"/><line x1="170" y1="232" x2="430" y2="232" stroke="#315760" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="205" y="145" width="190" height="62" rx="8" fill="#e5f0ed" stroke="#9bb8b5"/><path d="M224 167h45m15 0h45m15 0h31M224 185h60m16 0h74" stroke="#b0c6c3" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/></g>
<line id="draftLine" x1="458" y1="192" x2="458" y2="232" stroke="#bd5b34" stroke-width="2.5"/><path id="draftTop" d="M452 192l6-8 6 8" fill="none" stroke="#bd5b34" stroke-width="2.5"/><path id="draftBottom" d="M452 232l6 8 6-8" fill="none" stroke="#bd5b34" stroke-width="2.5"/>
<line x1="447" y1="122" x2="470" y2="122" class="scene-line"/><line x1="447" y1="251" x2="470" y2="251" class="scene-line"/>
<text x="64" y="179" class="scene-label">水面</text><text x="176" y="108" class="scene-label">船口边界</text><text x="464" y="215" class="scene-label" id="svgDraft">吃水</text><text x="48" y="307" class="scene-small">船底</text><text x="435" y="305" class="scene-small">水面到船底 = 吃水</text>
</svg>
<div class="readouts"><div class="readout"><span>当前吃水</span><strong id="draftValue">0.10 <em>m</em></strong></div><div class="readout"><span>水面到船口余量</span><strong id="freeboardValue">0.40 <em>m</em></strong></div></div>
</article>
<article class="card controls">
<h2>给船加货物</h2><p class="micro">只调整货物质量；船体自身重量固定为 200 kg。</p>
<div class="mass"><label for="cargo">货物质量</label><strong><span id="cargoValue">0</span><span style="font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:0"> kg</span></strong></div>
<input class="range" id="cargo" type="range" min="0" max="1000" step="10" value="0" aria-describedby="rangeHelp"><div class="limits"><span>0 kg</span><span>1000 kg</span></div><p class="sr-only" id="rangeHelp">键盘方向键可按步长调整。总质量达到 1000 千克时到达船口边界。</p>
<div class="presets" aria-label="快速选择货物质量"><button class="preset" data-mass="0" aria-pressed="true">空载</button><button class="preset" data-mass="300" aria-pressed="false">300 kg</button><button class="preset" data-mass="800" aria-pressed="false">到达边界</button><button class="preset" data-mass="1000" aria-pressed="false">超出边界</button></div>
<div class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"><strong id="statusTitle">船正漂浮</strong><p id="explanation">船体和货物合计 200 kg。要托住它，船体排开了 0.20 m³ 的水；在这个模型里，吃水是 0.10 m。</p></div>
<div class="readouts"><div class="readout"><span>船体自重 + 货物</span><strong id="totalMass">200 <em>kg</em></strong></div><div class="readout"><span>到达船口时最多可载</span><strong>800 <em>kg 货物</em></strong></div></div>
<div class="equation"><strong>模型关系</strong><p><code>吃水 d = 总质量 m ÷ (水密度 ρ × 水下截面积 A)</code></p><p>此船：A = 2 m²，ρ = 1000 kg/m³，船口高 H = 0.5 m。</p></div>
</article>
</section>
<section class="card explain"><h2>为什么加货会让船下沉？</h2><p>船下沉一点，就会排开更多水。静止漂浮时，水给船的向上浮力刚好平衡船体加货物的总重量。这里把真实船的复杂形状简化成直壁长方形：水下体积 = 截面积 × 吃水，所以质量增加时，吃水按比例增加。</p></section>
<section class="assumptions" aria-label="模型条件与来源">
<article class="card"><h2>模型条件与边界</h2><ul><li>船是水平、直立、刚性且不漏水的敞口长方形容器；水面静止。</li><li>忽略波浪、侧翻、船体变形，以及水进入船后的运动。</li><li>到达船口后，模型不再判断它是否稳定漂浮，也不推演进水过程。</li><li>“最多可载 800 kg”只对应这个自拟模型的船口边界，不是真船的安全载荷。</li></ul></article>
<article class="card"><h2>依据</h2><p class="source">浮体平衡关系：得克萨斯大学《Archimedes'"' Principle》讲义。https://farside.ph.utexas.edu/teaching/336L/Fluidhtml/node27.html</p><p class=\"source\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">船体几何、尺寸、质量与示意图均为本页面的教学设定，不代表某一艘真实船。</p></article>
</section>
</main>
<script>
(()=>{
 const cargo=document.getElementById('cargo'), cargoValue=document.getElementById('cargoValue'), draftValue=document.getElementById('draftValue'), freeboardValue=document.getElementById('freeboardValue'), totalMass=document.getElementById('totalMass'), status=document.getElementById('status'), statusTitle=document.getElementById('statusTitle'), explanation=document.getElementById('explanation'), water=document.getElementById('water'), wavePattern=document.getElementById('wavePattern'), boat=document.getElementById('boat'), draftLine=document.getElementById('draftLine'), draftTop=document.getElementById('draftTop'), draftBottom=document.getElementById('draftBottom'), svgDraft=document.getElementById('svgDraft'), badge=document.getElementById('sceneBadge');
 const A=2,rho=1000,H=.5,hull=200,boundary=rho*A*H,maxCargo=1000,waterlineTop=122,waterlineBottom=251,scale=(waterlineBottom-waterlineTop)/H;
 const fmt=n=>Number(n).toFixed(2);
 function update(){
   const cargoKg=Number(cargo.value),m=hull+cargoKg,atOrPast=m>=boundary,over=m>boundary;
   cargoValue.textContent=String(cargoKg);totalMass.innerHTML="'`${m} <em>kg</em>`;
   document.querySelectorAll('"'.preset').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(Number(b.dataset.mass)===cargoKg)));
   if("'!atOrPast){
     const d=m/(rho*A),y=waterlineBottom-d*scale,free=H-d;
     water.setAttribute('"'y',String(y));water.setAttribute('height',String(282-y));wavePattern.setAttribute('y',String(y));boat.setAttribute('transform',"'`translate(0 ${Math.max(0,Math.min(129,waterlineBottom-y))})`);
     const lineBottom=waterlineBottom+Math.max(0,Math.min(129,waterlineBottom-y));draftLine.setAttribute('"'y1',String(y));draftLine.setAttribute('y2',String(lineBottom));draftTop.setAttribute('d',"'`M452 ${y}l6-8 6 8`);draftBottom.setAttribute('"'d',"'`M452 ${lineBottom}l6 8 6-8`);
     draftValue.innerHTML=`${fmt(d)} <em>m</em>`;freeboardValue.innerHTML=`${fmt(free)} <em>m</em>`;svgDraft.textContent=`${fmt(d)} m`;
     status.classList.remove('"'warn');badge.textContent='漂浮平衡';statusTitle.textContent='船正漂浮';explanation.textContent="'`船体和货物合计 ${m} kg。要托住它，船体排开了 ${fmt(m/rho)} m³ 的水；在这个模型里，吃水是 ${fmt(d)} m。`;
   }else{
     water.setAttribute('"'y',String(waterlineTop));water.setAttribute('height','160');wavePattern.setAttribute('y',String(waterlineTop));boat.setAttribute('transform','translate(0 0)');
     draftLine.setAttribute('y1',String(waterlineTop));draftLine.setAttribute('y2',String(waterlineBottom));draftTop.setAttribute('d',"'`M452 ${waterlineTop}l6-8 6 8`);draftBottom.setAttribute('"'d',"'`M452 ${waterlineBottom}l6 8 6-8`);
     draftValue.innerHTML='"'— <em>m</em>';freeboardValue.innerHTML='0.00 <em>m</em>';svgDraft.textContent='边界';
     status.classList.add('warn');badge.textContent=over?'超过船口边界':'到达船口边界';statusTitle.textContent=over?'已超过进水边界':'已到达进水边界';
     explanation.textContent=over?"'`船体和货物合计 ${m} kg，已超过模型边界 ${boundary} kg。船口会没入水中；此后公式外推值不能当作实际吃水，也不代表稳定漂浮。`:`船体和货物合计 ${m} kg，恰好到达模型边界 ${boundary} kg。船口没有余量；页面停止给出稳定漂浮后的吃水。`;
   }
 }
 cargo.addEventListener('"'input',update);document.querySelectorAll('.preset').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{cargo.value=b.dataset.mass;update();cargo.focus()}));update();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
EOF
